PayoutsTest
├── When a payment is pending
│   └── It should prevent owner withdrawal of that payment.
├── When the owner withdraws completed sales
│   └── It should preserve losing bidders funds.
├── When a non owner withdraws proceeds
│   └── It should revert.
├── When the recipient rejects proceeds
│   └── It should preserve the proceeds credit.
├── When a non winner claims the NFT
│   └── It should revert.
├── When the winner claims before assignment
│   └── It should revert.
├── When the winner claims to another address
│   └── It should deliver the reserved NFT once.
├── When the NFT recipient rejects the transfer
│   └── It should preserve the winner claim.
├── When the owner withdraws before the NFT is claimed
│   └── It should preserve the NFT claim.
├── When an ETH recipient reenters owner withdrawal
│   └── It should block repeated spending.
├── When proceeds recipients or amounts are invalid
│   └── It should revert.
└── When ETH is forced into the contract
    └── It should not become owner proceeds.
